patch.summary:
Set the tenant's member-login policy (login vs roster). Owner/admin only;
enabling login requires the MemberSelfService capability (Starter+).
Switching to roster is always allowed (downgrade is never blocked).

email.description:
Optional. In login mode Cognito uses the email as the account username;
required in that mode and enforced in `register_member`. Roster-mode
members have no login and may omit email entirely.
